On the same DC-CSRC01 foothold, the operator installed AnyDesk, a remote desktop tool Cascadia's helpdesk normally uses only on end user workstations for unattended support, as a Windows service directly on the domain controller. The tool was never actually used afterward, its installation alone was the persistence mechanism, a redundant access channel independent of RDP and every harvested credential.
